      "widgets_values": [
        "",
        "Polished high-end fashion dress-up transformation video based on @Video1. A female model transforms between Street Fighter character cosplay costumes on a pure white photography studio background. Each costume is displayed with a clean minimalist outfit item panel on the left side showing accessories, clothing, and shoes with '1x' labels. The sequence includes: title card intro with 'Street Fighter' text, then smooth transitions through Chun-Li blue qipao fighter style, Cammy White Delta Red tactical style, Juri Han Feng Shui Engine style, and Manon ballet judo couture style. Maintain exact costume details, color palettes, layout composition, and text from the reference. Smooth cinematic motion, locked camera with no zoom, no perspective distortion, professional high-key fashion lighting, seamless character spin transitions.",
        "720p",
        "9:16",
        15,
        true,
        1313302476,
        "randomize",
        false,
        false
      ]
